  <issue>
  Ban `inserts` and `updates` in `filter` and `order by` clauses of `selects`
We should not allow queries like the following:

```
with X := Person select (X {name}, 1) filter {count ((insert Person {name := "t7"})) = 1} ;
```

```
select Foo
filter (insert Bar{val := 1}).val = 1 and false
```
  </issue>
  
